{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1162.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"052838509dead6de845e7f0fe8bdf4da5ac47cb6270897cdb2409fed654aedbe","ja":"気持ちいい～♪　「ホテルの近くなら散歩して\nいいぞ」って、言ってもらえてよかったね♪","zh":"好舒服～♪ 能得到允许说\n“只要在酒店附近散散步是可以的”，真是太好了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1162.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d53bfeced94be8e4148a897199510a414fb791edbdcdee67fb886de50b67045b","ja":"そうね……\nたまには夜の散歩っていうのもいいかも。","zh":"也是呢……\n偶尔在夜里散步或许也不错。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1162.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"3836cdb46a9a7a53a19ff0b31b83e744f0ee94981f2be02c53b41a3dd4e18f92","ja":"こういうのも、遠出したときの楽しみだよね。\nほら、星だってすっごくキレイに見えるし♪","zh":"这也是出远门时的乐趣之一呢。\n你看，连星星都看得格外清楚呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1162.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"275f01a703644ef5bad92b500d50db492551786b4d6b676b2aaef6585338e599","ja":"ほんとだ！　このあたりって、\n空気がキレイなんですね。気づかなかったな……。","zh":"真的耶！这一带的\n空气很清新呢。之前都没注意到……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1162.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"d57db9d445e36609afacdbdbe44c8c744ba85d40d293e7ace766b4ad05ea6600","ja":"見て見て！　あの星、静香ちゃんっぽいかも。\nそれであっちにあるのが恵美ちゃん星で、あれが私。","zh":"快看快看！那颗星，感觉挺像静香的呢。\n然后那边的是恵美星，那个是我。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1162.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"a7fbf439f6c6bf76264bc9fa1b57b65299e62b6f6266c74e48a85a562c4502bd","ja":"星って言っても、色とか光り方とか、\n色々個性があるんだね♪","zh":"虽说都是星星，但颜色和发光的方式\n也是各有特色呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1162.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"ff143c180d760e6c565954db0da05b164ff08defde98a5da5e0574f4bedef3c2","ja":"ふふっ……それなら他の星も、劇場のみんなですね。","zh":"呵呵……那么其他的星星，也是剧场的大家呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1162.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"1ec9725c337979f07ce78c42816e5e6912127fc7788edca7fd07572db61247ff","ja":"うん！　みんなが集まって輝いて……それで、\n次の武道館ではもっと大きな光になるんだよね！","zh":"嗯！大家聚在一起闪闪发光……然后，\n在下一次的武道馆绽放出更加巨大的光芒，对吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1162.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"7670e15fd7decd35b49fc19eba38b3372a0d50c4c99617d6618cd83e3b0a1a7d","ja":"……あっ！　だから私、武道館公演が、\nすっごく楽しみなのかも！","zh":"……啊！所以武道馆公演，\n我才会这么期待吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1162.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"dd8f20d60ae218aed9ca1daac809e21853f04efb612a4b2c005fe0e883f4c762","ja":"きっとそうだよ。なんてったって、\n次の公演がいよいよ集大成なんだし！","zh":"一定是这样的。毕竟，\n下一场公演终于要迎来集大成了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1162.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"e8f02b5d11eb7b312d02dd967eb923034fa030f02799effa6e58f4abece88546","ja":"武道館公演……\nこの星空みたいに、輝けるといいですね……！","zh":"武道馆公演……\n要是能像这片星空一样，闪闪发光就好了呢……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
